{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And Betzalel made.</b> Because of the ark's preeminence, he [Scripture] mentions that he made all the vessels of holiness. It mentions the Mishkan and the Tent, the parochet and the screen, for they are of one category. Then it mentions the anointing oil together with the incense of spices, for there are spices in the anointing oil and also in the incense of spices."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:47.218977615Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}